1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,500
When technical leaders depart,
institutional memory evaporates.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:09,000
Decisions lose their rationale,
conflicting dates persist uncorrected,

3
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:13,200
and mission-critical cloud infrastructure
sits silently orphaned.

4
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:19,500
We built Relay to ensure that when leadership
changes, institutional knowledge survives intact.

5
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:26,500
Relay operates as an
evidence-grounded continuity desk.

6
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:31,000
Outgoing leaders deposit operational memos,
charters, and roadmaps.

7
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:36,000
Rather than generating loose AI summaries,
Relay's extraction pipeline

8
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:42,500
anchors every single assertion to character-level
evidence coordinates in primary text.

9
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:49,000
Instead of smoothing over differences,
Relay cross-examines records

10
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:53,500
using property-aware semantic matching
across institutional facts.

11
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:57,800
Here, Document A specifies November 15
for product launch,

12
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:02,500
while an amendment memo references
December 20 following stress tests.

13
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:06,500
Relay flags a Direct Contradiction and surfaces
an unassigned Kubernetes cluster,

14
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:10,000
catching an operational liability
before an outage occurs.

15
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:16,000
This is where Switch and the Model Context
Protocol transform the workflow.

16
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:21,000
When the incoming leader asks about
the timeline in Switch,

17
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:25,500
the OpenCode agent executes
Relay's registered FastMCP tools.

18
00:01:25,700 --> 00:01:30,500
It audits open discrepancies, retrieves
the primary amendment evidence,

19
00:01:30,700 --> 00:01:35,500
and accurately explains the conflict
rather than guessing an answer.

20
00:01:35,700 --> 00:01:39,500
The agent then proposes escalating the issue
for formal human review.

21
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:44,500
Here is Relay's defining governance doctrine:

22
00:01:44,700 --> 00:01:49,500
An AI agent may discover discrepancies
and propose adjudications,

23
00:01:49,700 --> 00:01:54,500
but it must never possess authority
to unilaterally decide corporate truth.

24
00:01:54,700 --> 00:01:59,500
When human review is requested, Relay generates
a 32-byte single-use cryptographic token.

25
00:01:59,700 --> 00:02:05,000
Ratification strictly requires an authenticated
human reviewer verified through Mattermost.

26
00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:11,000
For the incoming leader, Relay compiles weeks
of manual archaeology

27
00:02:11,200 --> 00:02:16,000
into an audited 9-Chapter Handover Dossier
and a chronological Day 1 to 30 Roadmap.

28
00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:20,500
The interactive Continuity Radar visually maps
every relationship across people,

29
00:02:20,700 --> 00:02:26,500
projects, and critical infrastructure,
turning fragmented records into an operational compass.

30
00:02:29,500 --> 00:02:34,000
When evidence exists, Relay anchors answers
to exact source citations.

31
00:02:34,200 --> 00:02:38,000
When records are silent, it refuses to guess.

32
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:42,500
Backed by 229 verified automated tests,

33
00:02:42,700 --> 00:02:48,000
Relay ensures the next leader
never starts from zero.
